      "lines": [
        "Kabhi hum khoobsurat thay"
      ],
      "en": "Once, we were beautiful."
    },
    {
      "start": 37.48,
      "end": 40.88,
      "lines": [
        "Kitaabon mein basi"
      ],
      "en": "A scent lingered between the pages."
    },
    {
      "start": 41.24,
      "end": 43.56,
      "lines": [
        "Khushboo ki maanind"
      ],
      "en": "Our breath was like that lingering scent."
    },
    {
      "start": 44.48,
      "end": 47.76,
      "lines": [
        "Saans saakin thi"
      ],
      "en": "Our breath lay still."
    },
    {
      "start": 47.76,
      "end": 53.88,
      "lines": [
        "Bahut se ankahe lafzon se"
